      "description": "Faculty & librarian postings - Faculty & staff - UVic This website stores cookies on your computer. These cookies are used to collect information about how you interact with our website and allow us to remember your browser. We use this information to improve and customize your browsing experience, for analytics and metrics about our visitors both on this website and other media, and for marketing purposes. By using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by UVic’s Terms of Use for web and social media privacy .  If you do not agree to the above, you can configure your browser’s setting to “do not track.” Close Skip to main content Search Start page Search People Departments Maps Buildings Rooms A-Z University of Victoria Apply Library Search Sign in Online tools Sign out Show menu Faculty & staff Careers Academic leadership opportunities Faculty & librarian postings Staff postings Casual work Why work at UVic? Fair hiring & employment Pay & benefits Benefit handbooks Collective agreements Salaries & payroll Professional development Leaves & vacation Pensions & retirement Recognition & service Financial services & payroll Campus services Food & catering Transportation & parking Booking space Facilities requests Computer help & technology Safety & security Crisis & emergency supports Health & wellness Marketing & communications Hire a co-op student Career support services ONECard Bookstore Academics & research Advising framework Awards & honours Entrepreneurship International agreements Invention management Learning & teaching Library services Organizing field schools Registrar services & systems Research support Strategic initiatives Organization & governance About UVic Organization structure Our leadership Plans & strategies Campus update sessions Indigenous protocols & resources Policies & guidelines Privacy & access to information Info for... Info for... New faculty & staff Managers & supervisors Home Careers Faculty & librarian postings Faculty & librarian postings Faculty of Education Faculty of Engineering and Computer Science Faculty of Fine Arts Faculty of Humanities Faculty of Law Faculty of Science Faculty of Social Sciences Contact us Find the latest academic leadership positions . At UVic, we combine outstanding scholarship with inspired teaching and community engagement. We’re committed to recruiting, developing and retaining people who help us build a better future. We’re one of Canada’s leading research universities, with a vibrant community of: 21,965 STUDENTS (INCLUDING 3,138 GRADUATE STUDENTS) 5,660 FACULTY & STAFF March 2022 123,273 ALUMNI June 2022 Faculty of Education Curriculum and Instruction Faculty of Education (Curriculum and Instruction) Assistant or Associate Professor Faculty of Engineering and Computer Science Mechanical Engineering Faculty of Engineering and Computer Science (Mechanical Engineering) Assistant Professor Faculty of Engineering and Computer Science (Mechanical Engineering) Assistant Professor Faculty of Fine Arts Music Faculty of Fine Arts (Music) Assistant Teaching Professor Faculty of Fine Arts (Music) String Quartet: Assistant Teaching Professors Theatre Faculty of Fine Arts (Theatre) Assistant Professor Faculty of Humanities Faculty of Humanities (Theatre) Aspiration Research Chair Faculty of Humanities (Theatre) Assistant Professor Academic and Technical Writing Faculty of Humanities (Academic and Technical Writing) Assistant Teaching Professor Faculty of Humanities (Academic and Technical Writing) Assistant Teaching Professor Faculty of Law Faculty of Law (Academic and Technical Writing) Aspiration Research Chair Faculty of Science Mathematics and Statistics Faculty of Science (Mathematics and Statistics) Assistant Teaching Professor Faculty of Social Sciences Anthropology Faculty of Social Sciences (Anthropology) Assistant Professor Contact us Each UVic faculty or department coordinates their own faculty search and hiring process. You can find contact information listed at the bottom of each individual job posting. General inquiries: frrecruit@uvic.ca ​ UVic Instagram ​ UVic Facebook ​ UVic Twitter ​ UVic Linkedin ​ UVic YouTube View all UVic social media Quicklinks About UVic Admissions Research News & media Events Careers Donate Info for... Students Faculty & staff Alumni Indigenous International 2SLGBTQIA+ Business & industry Community University of Victoria 3800 Finnerty Road Victoria BC  V8P 5C2 Canada ​ Maps ​ Hours ​ Contacts Terms of use Accessibility Emergency contacts © University of Victoria Website feedback Back to top of page"
