ucation University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 9/1/2026 7 September 2026 997596.4 CUPE 951 - Term Program Administrator, Strathcona Island Medical Program University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 9/1/2026 15 September 2026 993076.2 CUPE 951 - Term Practica Coordinator Nursing University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/31/2026 Ongoing until filled 999084.1 PEA - Regular ONECard Clerk Campus Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/31/2026 13 September 2026 995445.6 CUPE 951 - Regular Cashier University Food Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/29/2026 7 September 2026 H9985.124 CUPE 917 - Regular Storekeeper - Foods University Food Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/29/2026 7 September 2026 H9986.22 CUPE 917 - Regular Cashier University Food Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/29/2026 7 September 2026 H9985.125 CUPE 917 - Regular Cashier University Food Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/29/2026 7 September 2026 H9985.123 CUPE 917 - Regular Educational Technology Strategist Learning and Teaching Support and Innovation University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/29/2026 7 September 2026 991465.2 PEA - Term Graduate Secretary Mechanical Engineering University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/28/2026 9 September 2026 997513.7 CUPE 951 - Term Communications Officer Office of the Registrar and Enrolment Management University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/28/2026 3 September 2026 993973.1 PEA - Regular Assistant to Faculty and Undergraduate Course Delivery Nursing University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/26/2026 8 September 2026 997866.5 CUPE 951 - Regular Service Worker II - UNFS University Food Services University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/26/2026 8 September 2026 S9935 - UNFS.26 CUPE 917 - Regular Department Secretary Civil Engineering University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/26/2026 8 September 2026 992842.2 CUPE 951 - Term Senior Data & AI Developer University of Victoria University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/25/2026 27 Septemeber 2026 989861.1 PEA - Term Associate Director, Marketing Operations Faculty of Business University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/25/2026 7 September 2026 989859.1 PEA - Term Senior Public Affairs Specialist Community and Government Relations University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/22/2026 13 September 2026 990722.1 Management Excluded - Term Casual, on-call, Service Worker I Facilities Management University of Victoria Victoria, BC, CA V8W 2Y2 8/22/2026 Ongoing until filled S9934.24 Casual Job Title Organizational Unit Location Date Opened Posting Close Date Req. # Employee Group: 1 2 Displaying 1 - 25 of 36 25 10 25 50 100 per page v18.5.3 Last sync: 2026-09-03 04:00:12 Quicklinks UVic home Why apply to UVic? How to apply? Casual work Faculty & librarian positions LinkedIn Human Resources Sedgewick Bldg. B146 3800 Finnerty Road Victoria BC  V8P 5C2 Canada 1-250-721-8085 Contacts Maps Hours Terms of use Accessibility © University of Victoria"
