      "title": "Why work",
      "description": "Why work at UVic? - Faculty & staff - UVic This website stores cookies on your computer. These cookies are used to collect information about how you interact with our website and allow us to remember your browser. We use this information to improve and customize your browsing experience, for analytics and metrics about our visitors both on this website and other media, and for marketing purposes. By using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by UVic’s Terms of Use for web and social media privacy .  If you do not agree to the above, you can configure your browser’s setting to “do not track.” Close Skip to main content Search Start page Search People Departments Maps Buildings Rooms A-Z University of Victoria Apply Library Search Sign in Online tools Sign out Show menu Faculty & staff Careers Academic leadership opportunities Faculty & librarian postings Staff postings Casual work Why work at UVic? Fair hiring & employment Pay & benefits Benefit handbooks Collective agreements Salaries & payroll Professional development Leaves & vacation Pensions & retirement Recognition & service Financial services & payroll Campus services Food & catering Transportation & parking Booking space Facilities requests Computer help & technology Safety & security Crisis & emergency supports Health & wellness Marketing & communications Hire a co-op student Career support services ONECard Bookstore Academics & research Advising framework Awards & honours Entrepreneurship International agreements Invention management Learning & teaching Library services Organizing field schools Registrar services & systems Research support Strategic initiatives Organization & governance About UVic Organization structure Our leadership Plans & strategies Campus update sessions Indigenous protocols & resources Policies & guidelines Privacy & access to information Info for... Info for... New faculty & staff Managers & supervisors Home Careers Why work at UVic? Why work at UVic? What UVic offers UVic community Employer of choice How to apply for jobs ‍ Staff postings Faculty postings Leadership opportunities At UVic, we combine outstanding scholarship with inspired teaching and community engagement. We’re committed to recruiting, developing and retaining people who help us build a better future. What UVic offers We know that our employees play a vital role in our success. In exchange, we offer: competitive pay great benefits generous vacation time funding for career development and a diverse range of learning and development opportunities spousal hire for faculty and librarians on-site child care relocation grants for eligible new employees discounted athletic facility membership sustainability initiatives an equitable and diverse work environment tools and resources to help you maintain a healthy work-life balance UVic community We’re one of Canada’s leading research universities, with a vibrant community of: 21,965 STUDENTS (INCLUDING 3,138 GRADUATE STUDENTS) 5,660 FACULTY & STAFF March 2022 123,273 ALUMNI June 2022 Employer of choice We’re one of the largest employers in Victoria. We’re also one of the Best Diversity Employers and Greenest Employers in Canada, as well as one of Canada's Top Employers. How to apply for jobs We post all staff postings at UVic through our online job-management system, UVic Careers . See our guide to applying to learn about: applying for a job – a step-by-step guide managing your application and checking application status preparing your resume and cover letter signing up for UVic Careers job alerts Each UVic faculty/department coordinates their own faculty and librarian search and hiring process. We post all faculty and librarian postings online on our faculty and librarian postings page. You will find information on how to apply listed at the bottom of each individual job posting. If you’re a current UVic employee applying for a position through the UVic Careers system, you must sign in using your Netlink ID. ​ UVic Instagram ​ UVic Facebook ​ UVic Twitter ​ UVic Linkedin ​ UVic YouTube View all UVic social media Quicklinks About UVic Admissions Research News & media Events Careers Donate Info for... Students Faculty & staff Alumni Indigenous International 2SLGBTQIA+ Business & industry Community University of Victoria 3800 Finnerty Road Victoria BC  V8P 5C2 Canada ​ Maps ​ Hours ​ Contacts Terms of use Accessibility Emergency contacts © University of Victoria Website feedback Back to top of page"
